msgid "<html><head/><body><p>The number of periodic dimensions.</p><p><br/></p><p>If this is set to 1, the material will be periodic only along the A vector of the crystal.</p><p><br/></p><p>If this is set to 2, the material will be periodic along both the A and B vectors of the crystal.</p><p><br/></p><p>If this is set to 3, the material will be periodic along the A, B, and C vectors of the crystal.</p><p><br/></p></body></html>"
